  "year": 2024,
  "arxivId": "2406.01967",
  "abstract": "DrEureka is a novel algorithm that leverages Large Language Models (LLMs) to automate sim-to-real transfer in robotics. By combining LLMs with simulation environments, DrEureka can learn complex low-level skills and transfer them to the real world without manual tuning. The approach uses LLMs to generate reward functions and domain randomization configurations, enabling the learning of robust policies that can adapt to real-world environments.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "DrEureka combines the strengths of Large Language Models (LLMs) and simulation environments to automate sim-to-real transfer in robotics. <strong>LLMs generate reward functions and domain randomization configurations</strong> to enable the learning of robust policies that can adapt to real-world environments.",
