    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "DrEureka uses a three-stage process to automate sim-to-real transfer. First, an LLM generates a <strong>reward function</strong> based on a task description and environment code. Then, the LLM uses the reward function to generate a <strong>domain randomization configuration</strong>, which is used to train a policy in simulation. Finally, the trained policy is transferred to the real world.",
